              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wabafundi bakhe wathi kuye: Nkosi, ngivumele ngiqale ngiyengcwaba ubaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
