              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, kwavuka isiphepho esikhulu elwandle, kangangokuthi umkhumbi wagutyungelwa amagagasi, kodwa yena wayelele.",
          "type": "text",
