              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kubo: “Nesabelani nina bokukholwa okuncane na? Wasevuka, wayikhuza imimoya nolwandle; kwaba khona ukuthula okukhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.26",
