            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esefike ngaphesheya ezweni lamaGergasi, kwahlangana naye ababili ababenamademoni, bephuma emathuneni, benolaka olukhulu, kwaze kwangadlula muntu ngaleyondlela.",
          "type": "text",
